dsh-stickerbook README · 图库格式：```
packs/
  blue-whale/
    pack.json        # { id, name, description, author, source, license, version }
    stickers.json    # { version: 1, items: [{ file, caption, emotion, tags, use }] }

用户图库放在 `~/.dsh/sticker-packs/<pack>/`，与插件包分开，升级插件不会丢。

dsh-stickerbook README · Pack format：```
packs/
  blue-whale/
    pack.json        # { id, name, description, author, source, license, version, credits }
    stickers.json    # { version: 1, items: [{ file, caption, emotion, tags, use }] }

User packs live in `~/.dsh/sticker-packs/<pack>/` so plugin upgrades never touch them.
